{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11113220","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11113220","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1111322001:0":{"text":"あんたたちの言う財宝ってのはなんだ？","source_cn":"说说看，你们所谓的宝藏，究竟是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECDC4D6E8135A0D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111322002:0":{"text":"けっ！何でもほいほい答えると思ったら大間違いだぜ！","source_cn":"呸！你想知道我就告诉你啊？哪有这种好事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19694993501A6E63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111322003:0":{"text":"次に口を開いたとき、オレの求める答えじゃなかったら……","source_cn":"如果你的下一句话，不能给出我想听到的答案。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC18FE9F42F669991","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111322004:0":{"text":"それが最後の言葉になると思え。","source_cn":"那么，这就是你的最后一句话了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x157D08F4B62723FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111322005:0":{"text":"か、勘弁してくれっ！言う、言うから！それで満足だろ！？","source_cn":"别、别这样，小哥，我说！我说还不行吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D0435557EACEF74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111322006:1":{"text":"オレは気が短いんだ。","source_cn":"我的耐心有限。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9886BF4C6D96E420","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111322007:0":{"text":"そもそも財宝は……<style=\"highlight\">存在しないんだよ。</style>","source_cn":"宝藏……<style=highlight>根本不存在！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8F386312A046342","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111322008:1":{"text":"なら、あんたたち商会の目的は何なんだ？","source_cn":"那么，黑金商会的目的是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FB8F7684729B0B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111322009:0":{"text":"残陽神の墓を暴くことさ！","source_cn":"打开残阳神的墓穴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x851A6AEEC0E70DA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1111322010:0":{"text":"噂に釣られた奴らに、残陽神の墓を暴いてもらうんだよ！","source_cn":"我们希望那些上当的人过来，打开残阳神的墓穴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA30774E5C0F62103","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111322011:0":{"text":"墓……？墓を暴く狙いは？","source_cn":"盗墓……你们想得到什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D4C9F02CB5F848D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":